{
 "format": "pcbpro",
 "version": 1,
 "name": "LM3886 Bass Amp",
 "author": "",
 "revision": "A",
 "notes": "LM3886 Bass Amp: TL072 preamp (Bassman-style passive tone stack with a x11 recovery stage), LM3886TF power amp (~50 W into 4-8 ohm on +/-30 V rails).\nTransformer 2 x 22 VAC 160 VA. The LM3886TF stands at the rear edge with its tab outward: bolt it to a heatsink of 1 K/W or better.\nImpedance-balanced DI on the XLR (pin 2 hot), taken before the tone controls.",
